  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 589a77387c7c4ea488d9368fe6c3cd2f, type: 3}
  m_Name: Dialogue 1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  characterName: Axion
  dialogues:
  - Welcome to the Neural Factory
  - 'Congratulations on your new job as MODEL ENGINEER!


    As our new engineer,
    you will be tasked with constructing a new production line in our factory. However,
    our factory does not use any run-of-the-mill factory components...'
  - You see, the Neural Factory uses the power of TRANSFORMERS to create its products.
    This means we don't have to build specific production lines for each product,
    or even know exactly what products are needed for a given order!
  - Instead, we take the SEQUENCE of resources needed for an order and TRANSFORM
    that sequence into the desired products.
  - But how do we do this? Let's take a closer look at the TRANSFORMER.
